# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in what you need. `.env` is gitignored.
#
#   VITE_*  → visible to the renderer (shipped in the JS bundle). NEVER put secrets here.
#   others  → main process only.
#
# Keys are validated at startup against src/shared/env/env-schema.ts.
#
# Your Anthropic API key does NOT go here. Paste it in the app's AI screen:
# it is stored encrypted by the OS (Electron safeStorage) and only the main
# process can read it.

# Optional crash reporting (Sentry). Must be an https:// URL.
# VITE_SENTRY_DSN=https://abc123@o0.ingest.sentry.io/0
